<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκλην</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>by surname, by name</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				221c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκλην ἀιθὴρ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					58d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξεώς τινος ἐ. λεγομένη</span>
			called <i>after . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				48c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαραπίων ἐ. βουκόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLips.</u>
					6.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Symp.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(8).529
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thasos</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τοῦ Αὐγούστου ἐ. λιμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					75.16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>nominally</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				3.13.4
			</span></i>.—Prop. acc. from an obsolete nom. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκλη</span>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκλησις, ἐπωνυμία</span>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκλην</span> (acc.) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν</span>, occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				38c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1018.6
			</span></i>.</div>
